# Character Abilities
ABILITY:Dark Tapestry Mystery Revelation|TYPE:NORMAL|CATEGORY:Special Ability|KEY:Dark Tapestry Mystery ~ Brain Drain|TYPE:OracleClassFeatures.SpecialAttack.OracleRevelation.DarkTapestryRevelation.Supernatural.RevelationTargetOneOnly|DESC:You can take a standard action to violently probe the mind of a single intelligent enemy within 100 feet. The target receives a Will save (DC %1) to negate the effect and immediately knows the source of this harmful mental prying. Those who fail this save are wracked with pain, taking %2d%3 points of damage. After successfully attacking with this ability, you may use a full-round action to sort through the jumble of stolen thoughts and memories to make a single Knowledge check using the victim's skill bonus. The randomly stolen thoughts remain in your mind for %4 rounds. Treat the knowledge gained as if you had used detect thoughts. This is a mind-affecting effect. You can use this ability %5/day.&pipe;BrainDrainDC&pipe;BrainDrainDice&pipe;BrainDrainDieType&pipe;BrainDrainDuration&pipe;BrainDrainTimes
ABILITY:Dark Tapestry Mystery Revelation|TYPE:NORMAL|CATEGORY:Special Ability|KEY:Dark Tapestry Mystery ~ Cloak of Darkness|TYPE:OracleClassFeatures.SpecialQuality.OracleRevelation.DarkTapestryRevelation.Supernatural|DESC:You conjure a cloak of shadowy darkness that grants you a +%1 armor bonus and a +%2 circumstance bonus on Stealth checks.  You can use this cloak for %3 hours per day.  The duration does not need to be consecutive, but it must be spent in 1-hour increments.&pipe;CloakOfDarknessArmorBonus&pipe;CloakOfDarknessStealthBonus&pipe;CloakOfDarknessTimes
ABILITY:Dark Tapestry Mystery Revelation|TYPE:NORMAL|CATEGORY:Special Ability|KEY:Dark Tapestry Mystery ~ Dweller in Darkness|TYPE:OracleClassFeatures.SpecialQuality.OracleRevelation.DarkTapestryRevelation.SpellLike|DESC:Once per day, you cast your psyche into the void of space to attract the attention of a terrible otherworldly being. The dweller in darkness behaves in all ways as if you had cast phantasmal killer.&pipe;!PRECLASS&colon;1,Oracle=17|DESC:Once per day, you cast your psyche into the void of space to attract the attention of a terrible otherworldly being. The dweller in darkness behaves in all ways as if you had cast weird.&pipe;PRECLASS&colon;1,Oracle=17
ABILITY:Dark Tapestry Mystery Revelation|TYPE:NORMAL|CATEGORY:Special Ability|KEY:Dark Tapestry Mystery ~ Gift of Madness|TYPE:OracleClassFeatures.SpecialAttack.OracleRevelation.DarkTapestryRevelation.Supernatural.RevelationTargetOneOnly|DESC:You tap into the unthinkable void between the stars and cause a single living creature within 30 feet to become confused for %1 rounds. A successful Will save (DC %2) negates the effect. This is a mind-affecting compulsion effect. You can use this ability %3/day.&pipe;GiftOfMadnessDuration&pipe;GiftOfMadnessDC&pipe;GiftOfMadnessTimes
ABILITY:Dark Tapestry Mystery Revelation|TYPE:NORMAL|CATEGORY:Special Ability|KEY:Dark Tapestry Mystery ~ Interstellar Void|TYPE:OracleClassFeatures.SpecialAttack.OracleRevelation.DarkTapestryRevelation.Supernatural.RevelationTargetOneOnly|DESC:You call upon the frigid depths of outer space to bring a terrible chill to your enemies. As a standard action|DESC: one target within 30 feet is cloaked in the void and takes %1d%2 points of cold damage. A successful Fortitude save (DC %3) halves this damage. You can use this ability %4/day.&pipe;InterstellarVoidDice&pipe;InterstellarVoidDieType&pipe;InterstellarVoidDC&pipe;InterstellarVoidTimes&pipe;!PRECLASS&colon;1,Oracle=10|DESC: one target within 30 feet is cloaked in the void and takes %1d%2 points of cold damage and is fatigued. A successful Fortitude save (DC %3) halves this damage. You can use this ability %4/day.&pipe;InterstellarVoidDice&pipe;InterstellarVoidDieType&pipe;InterstellarVoidDC&pipe;InterstellarVoidTimes&pipe;PREMULT&colon;2,&lbracket;!PRECLASS&colon;1,Oracle=15&rbracket;,&lbracket;PRECLASS&colon;1,Oracle=10&rbracket;|DESC: one target within 30 feet is cloaked in the void and takes %1d%2 points of cold damage and is exhausted and stunned for 1 round. A successful Fortitude save (DC %3) halves this damage. You can use this ability %4/day.&pipe;InterstellarVoidDice&pipe;InterstellarVoidDieType&pipe;InterstellarVoidDC&pipe;InterstellarVoidTimes&pipe;PRECLASS&colon;1,Oracle=15
USERPOOL:Dark Tapestry Mystery Revelation|POOLPOINTS:0.0
