ABILITY:Oracle Curse|TYPE:NORMAL|CATEGORY:Special Ability|KEY:Oracle ~ Infested|TYPE:OracleClassFeatures.SpecialQuality.OracleCurse|DESC:Insects, spiders, grubs, and other vermin plague you constantly. They crawl in your hair, fill your clothes, and fly or crawl into your mouth, nose, and ears. You take a -4 penalty on Diplomacy checks, and when you first meet someone, the person's initial attitude toward you starts one level lower than normal. Animals shy away from you-you take a -4 penalty on Handle Animal checks. You gain a +%1 bonus on Fortitude saves versus poisons from insects, scorpions, and spiders, as well as the distraction ability of swarms of such creatures.&pipe;OracleInfestedBonus|DESC:You gain DR 10/- against all swarm damage.&pipe;PRECLASS&colon;1,Oracle=7|DESC:You become immune to the swarm damage and the distraction ability of insect, scorpion, and spider swarms.&pipe;PRECLASS&colon;1,Oracle=17
USERPOOL:Oracle Curse|POOLPOINTS:0.0
